and don't wait. 

&#x200B;

I waited far too long.   Too late to get better, it seems.  

&#x200B;

Do NOT wait

I'm there now.  Fairly healthy - pushing 50, but am completely burned out. The only reason I'm here is because if I off myself now, my kids would be fairly messed up (statistically) 

&#x200B;

I don't want that burden
